{"id":"conv_04927","context":"Two managers prep an inter-department joint event","ambient":"office_quiet_low","cast":["yuki_office","kenji_office"],"tier":4,"lines":[{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"Regarding the joint event, we've had repeated preliminary discussions, so I'd like to settle the direction soon.","jp":"合同イベントの件、事前討議を重ねてきましたが、そろそろ方向性を固めたいですね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,4,5,6,8,14,17,28,51,62,106,184,621,744,872,1999,2330,2483,3104,4781,5144,5264,5984,8387,9250,17287],"jpTokens":[{"s":"合同","r":"ごうどう","w":5144},{"s":"イベント","w":872},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"件","r":"けん","w":621},{"s":"、"},{"s":"事前","r":"じぜん","w":2330},{"s":"討議","r":"とうぎ","w":8387},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"重ね","r":"かさね","w":9250},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"き","w":184},{"s":"まし","w":14},{"s":"た","w":8},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"、"},{"s":"そろそろ","w":2483},{"s":"方向","r":"ほうこう","w":744},{"s":"性","r":"せい","w":106},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"固め","r":"かため","w":17287},{"s":"たい","w":62},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"ね","w":51},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"Yes, but Sales and Planning's opinions are running completely in parallel lines with no sign of converging.","jp":"ええ、ただ営業部と企画部の意見が完全に平行線をたどっていて、まとまる気配がありません。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,4,5,6,9,14,18,22,26,39,54,247,299,321,712,1050,1059,1078,3039,5378,7885,8415,9114,9856,10198,13947],"jpTokens":[{"s":"ええ","w":3039},{"s":"、"},{"s":"ただ","w":247},{"s":"営業","r":"えいぎょう","w":1078},{"s":"部","r":"ぶ","w":321},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"企画","r":"きかく","w":1050},{"s":"部","r":"ぶ","w":321},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"意見","r":"いけん","w":299},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"完全","r":"かんぜん","w":712},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"平行","r":"へいこう","w":8415},{"s":"線","r":"せん","w":1059},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"たどっ","w":13947},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"い","w":18},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"まとまる"},{"s":"気配","r":"けはい","w":5378},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あり","w":22},{"s":"ませ","w":14},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"That's exactly the issue. A half-hearted compromise could provoke major dissatisfaction later.","jp":"そこなんです。中途半端に妥協すると、後で大きな不満を引き起こす可能性がありますし。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[2,5,6,9,10,14,17,19,21,22,26,39,106,199,220,267,1988,2690,2823,4298,5980,6753,8437,9114,10683,12196],"jpTokens":[{"s":"そこ","w":220},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"ん","w":26},{"s":"です","w":17},{"s":"。"},{"s":"中途半端","r":"ちゅうとはんぱ","w":5980},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"妥協","r":"だきょう","w":6753},{"s":"する","w":19},{"s":"と","w":9},{"s":"、"},{"s":"後で","r":"あとで","w":4298},{"s":"大きな","r":"おおきな","w":267},{"s":"不満","r":"ふまん","w":2690},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"引き起こす","r":"ひきおこす","w":8437},{"s":"可能","r":"かのう","w":199},{"s":"性","r":"せい","w":106},{"s":"が","w":6},{"s":"あり","w":22},{"s":"ます","w":14},{"s":"し","w":10},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"kenji_office","mood":null,"en":"So how about placing both departments on equal footing and framing it as a co-starring arrangement up front?","jp":"だから両部署を対等な立場に置いて、共演という形で前面に出すのはどうでしょう。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,2,3,4,5,7,17,21,29,32,93,110,117,368,476,763,1010,1256,1847,2280,2950,5004,6947,8400,8428,8599],"jpTokens":[{"s":"だから","w":476},{"s":"両","r":"りょう","w":1847},{"s":"部署","r":"ぶしょ","w":6947},{"s":"を","w":5},{"s":"対等","r":"たいとう","w":8428},{"s":"な","w":21},{"s":"立場","r":"たちば","w":763},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"置い","r":"おい","w":2950},{"s":"て","w":4},{"s":"、"},{"s":"共演","r":"きょうえん","w":8400},{"s":"という","w":32},{"s":"形","r":"かたち","w":368},{"s":"で","w":7},{"s":"前面","r":"ぜんめん","w":8599},{"s":"に","w":2},{"s":"出す","r":"だす","w":1010},{"s":"の","w":1},{"s":"は","w":3},{"s":"どう","w":110},{"s":"でしょ","w":17},{"s":"う","w":29},{"s":"。"}]},{"speaker":"yuki_office","mood":null,"en":"I see — making the equal relationship explicit would also preserve morale on the ground.","jp":"なるほど、対等な関係を明示すれば、現場のモチベーションも保てますね。","nonverbal":false,"jpSilence":false,"words":[1,5,11,14,19,21,41,51,143,314,1039,1999,3280,4286,6576,7284,8428,13573],"jpTokens":[{"s":"なるほど","w":3280},{"s":"、"},{"s":"対